N2  - The idea of combining ontology with metadata can solve problems of heterogeneity of databases integration. The framework of ontology-based metadata management system, the layered principle and the design project is presented. In this system, the schema information of a local database is described by using metadata, and then the concept of ontology is imported to describe the relations between terms of metadata. A layered approach is considered to metadata management and then an semantically unified global schema is provided for users to shield heterogeneity of the rock-bottom databases. By extracting much more useful information from metadata, this system can solve multiform semantic problems of data integration and can deal with the query of databases simply.
